Tailored wool-blend blazer, structured lapel fit, knee-length hem, charcoal gray, 100% virgin wool;
Silk-trimmed satin blouse, relaxed collar cut, hip-length hem, ivory white, 100% silk;
Pleated crepe trousers, straight-leg silhouette, ankle length, deep midnight blue, heavy-weight crepe;
Stiletto pumps, pointed toe design, mid-calf heel height, metallic gold, patent leather;
Diamond-stud chandelier earrings, open-back setting, earlobe dangle style, clear crystal accents, 18k white gold plated;
Pearl-button cufflinks, round face cut, standard link closure, lustrous white, freshwater cultured pearls;

This outfit perfectly balances your requested formality levels by offering the sophistication of a suit-like silhouette in textured crepe and refined wool. The metallic gold shoes and sparkling earrings add a festive celebratory touch appropriate for a New Year's dinner while keeping the look elegant rather than overly rigid. Since the weather feels frosty, the warm wool blazer provides necessary protection without adding bulk, ensuring comfort throughout your evening. The classic neutral palette accented by midnight blue allows you to shine under restaurant lighting while adhering strictly to your dress code preferences.
